<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-RAIN STOPS BELGIUM V DENMARK DAVIS CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RAIN STOPS BELGIUM V DENMARK DAVIS CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain stopped play in a Davis</p>
<p>Cup Euro/African zone group one second round tie between Belgium</p>
<p>and Denmark on Saturday.</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf/Libor Bimek (Belgium) v Frederik</p>
<p>Fetterlein/Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 3-6 2-1 - game abandoned</p>
<p>due to weather</p>
</text>
